@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@outfitId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
@itemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 保存布局，替换为搭配及其真实单品 ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/canvas/{{outfitId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "width": 1080,
  "height": 1440,
  "layers": [
    {
      "item_id": "{{itemId}}",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 180,
      "scale": 1.2,
      "rotation": 0,
      "opacity": 1,
      "z_index": 0
    }
  ]
}

### 读取布局及当前引用状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/canvas/{{outfitId}}
Accept: application/json

### 仅删除布局
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/canvas/{{outfitId}}
